  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n1/13 Speight Road is a wonderful 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom lock-and-leave coastal property, only minutes' walk away from the beach and the many delights of Kohimarama. Chic and comfortable, with luxuries like underfloor heating, a sleek modern kitchen, and an internal lift, making the top floor easily accessible.\r\n\r\nThe downstairs open-plan living, dining, and kitchen open onto a private, north-facing, walled patio - ideal for entertaining. Two gas fireplaces keep the space warm through winter, and the laundry and bathroom round out the amenities on the lower level. Upstairs, 3 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms (2 of which are ensuites) offer very comfortable accommodations to residents or guests, and skylights create a bright, light feel.\r\n\r\nThere is an internal-access double garage and plenty of storage throughout. The patio area boasts an outdoor fireplace and spa pool, ideal for evenings at home, or walk a few minutes to enjoy oceanfront dining and an incredible Rangitoto view. \r\n\r\nThe home is close to cafes and eateries, a yacht club, sports clubs, and the popular Tamaki Drive coastal path, plus Selwyn College and Kohimarama School.\r\n\r\nEnquire with Leila or David for more information or to view.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
